@table @code
@item initrd-binary
binary size (measured in CI on every build). The binary the initrd carries: `bin/fairing` of the flake's `fairing-initrd` package, built by nixpkgs without default features as the NixOS module builds it (decided at G1, 2026-10-16); CI's `nix` job. A cargo build of the same features comes out smaller and is reported by the size job only.
@item theme-artefact
artefact size (measured in CI on every build). The reference theme compiled with `fairing theme compile themes/steelbore.ncl`; CI's size job.
@item first-frame
cold-start latency (measured on the reference machine). `first_frame_ms` of `fairing preview --backend drm`, process start to the first frame on screen, on a free VT.
@item artefact-load
theme load time (measured on the reference machine). `load_ms` of `fairing theme compile themes/steelbore.ncl --json`, the reference artefact decoded from its bytes.
@item sigterm-release
release latency (measured on the reference machine). `release_ms` of the stage-2 splash report at the greetd handoff, from the journal of a reference boot.
@item fbdev-fallback
fallback latency (measured on the reference machine). The failed DRM attempt's `elapsed_ms` plus the fbdev first frame of `fairing preview --backend auto` with the DRM device withheld.
@item reacquire
re-acquire latency (measured on the reference machine). From the simpledrm-to-i915 swap in the journal to the next presented frame, on a reference boot.
@item ask-detect
question latency (measured on the reference machine). From the `ask.*` file's creation to the `ASK_OPENED` journal line, on a reference boot with a LUKS root.
@item grab-release
grab release latency (measured on the reference machine). From the answer's reply to the `ASK_CLOSED` journal line, on a reference boot with a LUKS root.
@item overlay-entry
journal overlay latency (measured on the reference machine). From a `logger -p notice` entry to its line in the overlay, timed on the reference machine.
@end table
